     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 18pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/5/202305240910165404.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202305240910165404.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.36in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中积极贯彻“五育并举”，扎实开展阳光体育</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">近段时间在一系列体育赛事中赛出了风格、水平，让</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中学子的飒爽英姿</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">频频闪耀各大赛</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">场</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>市直田径运动会勇夺团体总分第一名</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5月19日至20日在绍兴市直中学生田径运动会上，我校学子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">团结</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">拼搏</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奋勇</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">争先</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以顽强的意志品质、突出的技战术水平突破</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自我</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">战胜对手，取得了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市直学校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">团体总分第一名的好成绩，并获得了优秀组织奖，王斌老师获最佳教练员称号，胡沁文同学获最佳运动员称号。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">赛后</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，校党委书记、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校长王琛</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，副校长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">亲切看望了参赛运动员队，并</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为获奖运动员颁发了证书，鼓励</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中运动员</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">们</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，把赛场上的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">拼搏</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">精神带到日常学习工作中，做</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自信阳光、奋发有为、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全面发展的新时代好少年。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/5/202305240910385759.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202305240910385759.jpg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">获得第一名的运动员：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">108  谢王昕（50M）    113金星宇(400M)       202单锦豪(跳高\立定三级跳)</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">209  朱诗楷 (50M)      214刘畅 (1500M)       112胡沁文(铅球\标枪 破县纪录</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;">
