</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>市直羽毛球比赛取得优秀成绩</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3月3日—4日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2023年市直羽毛球运动会在绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">举行，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经过两天的激烈角逐，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动员们为绍兴一中拿下女子团体第二名，男子团体第五名的优秀成绩。并斩获多个单项奖，同时获得体育道德风尚奖。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.36in;">
